  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0039_87b680609579.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 165px;\" /></p><p>Let the masses of the three parts be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>.</p><p>Momentum of first part&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;and momentum of second part&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>.</p><p>Third part will fly in a direction opposite to the direction of resultant of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, so that total momentum of the system after explosion remains zero.</p><p>Momentum of the third part is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math></p><p>Velocity of third part,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  }
